  "content": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br/>Autoridades comunales y el Club Deportivo Juventud encabezaron la primera jornada festiva, que incluyó presentaciones de agrupaciones folclóricas infantiles y talleres locales.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br/>La comunidad de Quenuirana, específicamente el Club Deportivo Juventud, dio inicio a la ruta de inauguración de las Fondas 2026 en Maullín. En la actividad estuvieron presentes el alcalde de la comuna Nabih Soza Cárdenas, la concejal Carmen Serón, la concejal Luz Eliana Antecao, el concejal Orlando Torres y el concejal Rodrigo González, junto al administrador municipal Luis Valdivia. Los dirigentes del club dieron la bienvenida al público y a las familias asistentes, destacando el Esquinazo Piedra de Cueca, en el que también participaron agrupaciones folclóricas infantiles del sector y talleres folclóricos locales.</p>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-14737\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/lb1zwkodu3eeb04/dsc_9350_1024x683_w146t8vfk5.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-14741\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/8ubaht35suw59rx/dsc_9364_1024x683_x2z6c0myhm.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-14742\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/5mq7kfxh3p00xge/dsc_9398_1024x683_dj9mm1v3vd.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-14745\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/5mfz1sciw6vphmr/dsc_9455_1024x683_lmy8hssnwm.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-40 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-14736\" data-id=\"14736\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/5q13at7b5019x73/dsc_9328_1024x683_yhdtrdju6v.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-14733\" data-id=\"14733\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/4woq8sgi9cvuu87/dsc_9332_1024x683_n9tqukmeha.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-14734\" data-id=\"14734\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/un1gmpwwu5j3wca/dsc_9335_1024x683_jy2u276v13.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-14735\" data-id=\"14735\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/fi